Maidan-E-Karbala Me Yeh Zainab Ke Bain Hai<br>
Abbas Fouj-e-Shaam Me Tanha Hussain Hai<br>
<br>
1.Hai Jiske Ek Ishare Me Kounain Ki Najaat<br>
Ghudhe Se Jhoomta Hai Wahin Shah-e-Kayinath<br>
Aajou Ab Madad Ku Hai Kuch Dur Hai Furat<br>
<br>
2.Pushte Faras Se Girta Hai Zehra Ka Noor-e-Aain<br>
Rote Khade Hai Aale Paiyambar Bashoor-o-Shain<br>
Zakhmou Se Chur Chur Hai Bhaiya Mera Hussain<br>
<br>
3.Buqz-o-Hasad Ke Zulm Ke Tevar Liye Howe<br>
Hamraha Apne Saath Sitamgar Liye Howe<br>
Shimre Layeen Badhta Hai Khanjar Liye Howe<br>
<br>
4.Mujh Bad Naseeb Se Mera Bhai Bhichadta Hai<br>
Bhai Ka Kis Behan Ne Nazara Yeh Dekha Hai<br>
Zaanu Daabe Ke Seene Maloon Baitha Hai<br>
<br>
5.Zainab Ka Nouha Tha Jameel Akber Yeh Bar Bar<br>
Abbas Aao Nehar Se Tum Par Behan Nisar<br>
Zalim Ne Kaat Daala Sar-e-Shah-eZulfikhar
